              "text": "<strong >Chapter 4 Overview</strong>"
            }
          },
          {
            "template_id": "paragraph_large",
            "content": {
              "text": "UNDP works with partners in developing countries to advance sustainable and low-carbon energy transition. This work is anchored by its <a href=\"https://www.undp.org/publications/undp-strategic-plan-2022-2025\"><strong ><u >Strategic Plan 2022-2025</u></strong></a><strong >. </strong><br /> <br />Energy – along with poverty and inequality, governance, resilience, environment, and gender equality – are <strong >among the six signature solutions of the Strategic Plan.</strong> Together, the signature solutions represent UNDP’s vision to accelerate progress on the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). <br /> <br />This chapter provides more details on UNDP's Sustainable Energy Academy initiative."
            }
          }
        ]
